WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:05.820
This is consumer genetic engineering.

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:08.960
I think it's really going to become a consumer
industry.

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:09.960
What do I want?

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:12.429
I want my yeast to, I want them to smell like
this.

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:14.260
I want them to ferment faster.

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:15.280
Yeast that glow.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:16.220
We give people the ability

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:18.220
to take a gene from a jellyfish

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:19.360
and stick it in a yeast

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:21.380
that they're going to use to brew,

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:22.840
bake, or something like that.

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:24.460
And with the FDA

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:25.760
Everything is just, "No."

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:26.360
"What about this?"

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:26.860
"No."

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.380
"How much of this can be allowed in there?"

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:29.040
"No. Nothing."

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:31.040
"Zero. No. No!"

